{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51805","headline":"落花（句） · 蒋维东","name":"落花（句）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"流水从将去，春风解送来。\n（以上《五代诗话》六引《零陵总记》〖3〗）（〖1〗宋马永易《实宾录》卷十一《山长》条云：「五代零陵蒋维东好学，能属文。\n乾佑中尝隐居衡岳，从而受业五十余）（人，号维东爲山长云。\n」〖2〗《诗话总龟》题作《旅中书怀》。\n〖3〗见《增修诗话总龟》卷二十一引《零陵总记》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒋维东","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51805.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51805","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}